  "tagline": "An island Wikipedia calls \"the most alien-looking place on Earth.\"",
  "intro": "Socotra is the largest island of a six-island archipelago in the Indian Ocean, about 380 km south of the Arabian Peninsula and 232 km east of the Horn of Africa. It is politically part of Yemen but geologically a fragment linked to the Somali plate. It was recognised as a UNESCO World Heritage Site in 2008.",
